unreal-speccy-portable-wx (0.0.91-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial source-based Debian package for the wxWidgets desktop
    variant, packaged in parallel with unreal-speccy-portable (SDL2).
  * Build via CMake + wxWidgets + OpenAL Soft + GLEW, using system
    libraries (USE_SYS_LIBS=ON) for a fast, dependency-clean build.

